      "text": "Each second, the rod sweeps out zero point two five times four point zero, one point zero square metre. So the flux changes by zero point three zero webers every second, and the emf is zero point three zero volts. Once the rod stops, the area stops changing, so the emf is zero. The slip is thinking the emf stays because the field is still there. A field alone does nothing.",
